    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be two functions defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced close=\"\"><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
