  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>y</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
